# No .env file is required. Vault selection belongs in .memory-loop/config.json;
# transport and the private token belong in separate JSON/token files. See README.
# Neither VAULTS_DIR nor PORT/HOSTNAME configures this application's launchers.
# Both tiers bind to 127.0.0.1; select a strict port with the documented CLI flags.
#
# Optional server-only selector, preferably set explicitly in the launch environment:
# MEMORY_LOOP_TRANSPORT_FILE=/absolute/path/to/.memory-loop/transport.json
# Never put a bearer token here or in NEXT_PUBLIC_* / Next config env mappings.
# Use Bun --no-env-file for launches; Next still has its own dotenv handling.
